# ASEP Traceability Ignore Specification
# Ignore template files and adaptive skeletons containing illustrative token placeholders
**/templates/**
**/skeletons/**
# Exclude test fixtures whose tags are string-literal test data (not real declarations)
spec-engine/tests/
# Exclude integration test fixtures and benches whose tags are illustrative data (not real declarations)
srcidx/tests/
**/benches/**

